"limits":["Research-only first-order composition after complete original mechanics; no original source, calibration, controller or production API changes.","Physical cavity pressure and original proxy pressure units are not calibrated to each other; cavity stem is diagnostic and direct air mix gain is zero. Sharing export gain does not make their levels physically comparable.","Source-off removes only the injected cavity pressure event; passive air can still be excited by strings, board and mechanisms. Coupling-off retains cavity source and losses. Load-off removes the entire air module.","Mechanism gain, cavity geometry, board moving area, resistance and player proximity/loss budget are authored. No fit to ambiguous library pedal low frequencies or material claims.","Lid 0/0.5/1 are separately prepared static aperture geometries; not live lid motion. One cavity/aperture mode is not a three-dimensional air field, lid plate, room or anatomical player.","Same notes, pedal events, seed, gains and room-none path across targets; only stated source/coupling/load ablations differ.","No recording/listening validation, production quality, SDK or host real-time guarantee. Reserved mechanism corpus remains unopened."]
